{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "0253c9da6966c3484df65305d423346759e6a6a4204e74401bc6aaa0ed0573d5", "ja": "私だけ見てくれたらいいのに", "zh": "要是只注视着我就好了", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9cabed00bfa5a0c4b1ed1ad4f82c349a547d8448aabaafe4bb34c2025416046b", "ja": "西エリアの思い出話は続く。現地のアイドル\n達に囲まれたプロデューサーを取り返しに行\nった一同。トラブルはなかったが、ライブは\n押され気味になってしまった、と。その後、\n帰宅した昴は、兄達に不満を語るのだが……", "zh": "关于西区的回忆仍在继续。众人为了把被当地偶像们团团围住的制作人抢回来而赶了过去。虽然没有发生什么麻烦，但演出却稍显被动。此后，昴回到家里，向哥哥们诉说着心中的不满……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a4868c69d92d731d22cf63af341558a07abdb745f35e0655cfca25f4da71262f", "ja": "（西エリアで、共演相手のアイドルに挨拶をしに\n来ただけなのに……何故か、囲まれてしまった！）", "zh": "（明明只是来向西部地区的共演偶像打个招呼……怎么不知不觉被围住了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1001_nishiidola", "source_sha256": "0a99bcec8eda37a017fe34413a260e95045cca30ae1c6a9ad05fcb32c9da274a", "ja": "この人にプロデュースしてもらったら、\nうちらも今より美人になるかもなぁ。あはは♪", "zh": "要是让这个人来制作我们，说不定我们也会比现在更漂亮呢。啊哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "02f63a5dbb14a58ebb0ddb5a51de5920e2ece5defe52537d9b9e59219c3db25c", "ja": "いえいえいえ、そんな必要はないかと……。\nあの、もうこの辺で……！", "zh": "不不不，没那个必要吧……。那个，差不多就到这里吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1003_nishiidolb", "source_sha256": "581198c4c45015e384726fb268bd911d13298ee1a6bc444ceea94cf60131958c", "ja": "お上手やわぁ。もう少しお話しましょう？\nプロデューサーはん、ふふ……♪", "zh": "您做得真好。要不要再聊一会儿？\n制作人先生，呵呵……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e72a897ce158bf284ae347f1d99e49d9e54d44bfdadae9d89d2977fbe85ff483", "ja": "（ど、どうしたらいいんだ……！）", "zh": "（我、我该怎么办才好啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "af5286329e5abca1a6a48dd98398cd392e58e6cf6e009f8bf5a3f07e085fc283", "ja": "む～～～……。", "zh": "唔～～～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "3eab1e10ee132cba587d6f4d0a8818a86cb53193f7c414b579773bf5423412ff", "ja": "{$P$}、ずっと捕まってる。\nライブ前だし、作戦会議もしたいんだけどな～。", "zh": "{$P$}，一直被缠着呢。\n毕竟马上就要演出了，我也想开个作战会议啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "d915d9c786cd835ad9a4b62bf4a886e8f1e052d69dd5efa1c7b5dc110544efbf", "ja": "挨拶にしても、長いですしね。\n……。", "zh": "就算只是打个招呼，也太久了。\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "45b920a18266d607f4a9e08054fa948927af99ce2234a5beaacb83d5fd8e2a28", "ja": "もしかして……あの人たちの狙いは、\n最初から{$P$}さんだった……？", "zh": "难道……那些人的目标，\n从一开始就是{$P$}先生……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1009_011ami", "source_sha256": "a8cfe59ea2e259334c5a669d1e5068d81e8dd7d08605a2eb0b77d79568981f4c", "ja": "あーっ！？　それだよ、しほりん！", "zh": "啊——？！就是那个，志保玲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "77775ac5b1cdd3e0756098e7bd3cf203287bb7d57e2d7d5acca9cfa6d9eac616", "ja": "兄ちゃんを捕まえて、亜美たちに作戦会議させない\nつもりなんだよ！　亜美としたコトが不覚だった……！", "zh": "你是打算抓住哥哥，不让亚美她们召开作战会议吧！亚美居然会犯下这种失误……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "6a51e459dff9c894a5e7174329277ce10afa05565f76b028963adb21f397ccfc", "ja": "『将を射んと欲すればまず馬を射よ』ですね……！", "zh": "“想射人先射马”呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "30b3ef623ccb2dc2e891034a31da1b26a753c4764a99a6d7764f1b4f064b0be2", "ja": "え？　{$P$}が馬？", "zh": "诶？{$P$}是马？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "cfcbd1c239fecc40645ed1eaa8bcf90797161520a25c26c7b0f74c919b9d56ba", "ja": "とにかく、このままだとよくない気がします。", "zh": "总之，我觉得这样下去不太好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "9e20ba7430a670909cb07b7586dfe7b9c23ad2c9a097019ea19860c4fe8ae237", "ja": "ここは、少し強引に割り込んででも、\n{$P$}さんを取り戻したほうが……。", "zh": "这里，就算要稍微强硬地插手，也还是把{$P$}先生夺回来比较好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "a5b7ac8051df2ad19bfcff4eb6966ec29069a965b35825b68ef620ff802e0969", "ja": "そういうコトなら、亜美の出番だ！\n……てやーっ！", "zh": "既然是这种事，那就轮到亚美出场了！\n……嘿呀——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1016_032emi", "source_sha256": "8837195caa32dabbf84d4e05ce39a4ed6b8f5766c5395bb8131f66ca7357b0db", "ja": "あ、亜美さん！？", "zh": "啊，亚美小姐！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1017_011ami", "source_sha256": "2405b1cb153b01d42e0af294b21631d01ad4dde21f4f8b84525a4a6a4f52373a", "ja": "ちょっと、兄ちゃんっ！！\nライブ前のミーティング、時間なくなっちゃうよ！", "zh": "等等，哥哥！！\n演出前的会议要没时间了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1018_p", "source_sha256": "20a8c2e1b733b2f136dea699541b5a4f8eb7dff215350ac8e58e89e6a925a90f", "ja": "そ、そうだな！\nあの、そういうわけなので……。", "zh": "对、对啊！  \n那个，因为是这么回事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1019_nishiidolb", "source_sha256": "79bfe80598bdd36d4edd9422e02e8cdb76a263c7de1a0afd963326060898588c", "ja": "いけずやなぁ。\nちょっとお話してただけやのに……。", "zh": "真狠心啊。\n人家只是稍微聊了聊天而已嘛……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1020_nishiidola", "source_sha256": "dc021895a612b96b1bf775deaec3c3b3ec80e6470626f23ea8eb9c2e2965397e", "ja": "ほな、うちらもミーティングしとこか。\nまたな、プロデューサーはん♪", "zh": "那么，我们也开个会吧。\n回头见，制作人♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1021_011ami", "source_sha256": "738453fbde8ea7fb39e43998e3fdd63ffe40e17f6e294e788a1c3ae4f737d940", "ja": "イケスだかナマズだか知んないけど、兄ちゃんは\n亜美たちの兄ちゃんなんだから！　イーッだ！", "zh": "不管是养鱼池还是什么鲶鱼，哥哥就是亜美她们的哥哥嘛！略略略！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1022_p", "source_sha256": "955177c8844e2d6737f72a666e55e9464292f826a5ec346a34029e186e5a00d5", "ja": "こ、こら、亜美！\nすみません、失礼します！", "zh": "喂、喂，亚美！\n抱歉，失礼了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1024_p", "source_sha256": "6fc9378b2974a5e376461306eadadaf9542fc6243ab40fa8bf6379fbdd5e202c", "ja": "という事がありまして……。", "zh": "事情就是这样……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1025_102mis", "source_sha256": "bfb1e56b1fe4b1cc07d6e2a5f2cdf4a5d1a1d5009a1007c3a5faf7b327b9831c", "ja": "なるほど～。\nそんなことが……。", "zh": "原来如此～  \n竟然发生了那种事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1026_047sub", "source_sha256": "e311b3d7fa17c657783ef7b01bcf703bacc806cbe0dfc50bec6691d2d0da4b97", "ja": "結局その後のライブ、なんか調子でなかったよな。\n相手に押され気味だったっていうか……。", "zh": "结果那之后的演出，总觉得状态不太好啊。该说是有点被对方压制了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1027_011ami", "source_sha256": "680b194114a1e54ab6e22ae0479fd4db4b3ed681010992913032651670b7c2dc", "ja": "そうそう！　それというのも、すべて兄ちゃんが\n仕事に牛を混ぜるからだよ！　子牛ナントカだよ！", "zh": "对对！那都是因为哥哥把牛混进工作里了！就是那个小牛什么的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1028_p", "source_sha256": "0c5299772839d2a67321444b8ac55732051545ca5a84ff2fff1850bbae536b83", "ja": "仕事に牛？　……あ、もしかして公私混同って事か？\nいや、そんなつもりはないんだけど……。", "zh": "工作里掺牛？……啊，难道是指公私混同？\n不，我没那个意思……】【。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1029_p", "source_sha256": "31d1616d53e4afe7f9bd6c1840843cedc5c7cc3acc1656a63f9bb8584eff4a0c", "ja": "とにかく、みんなを不安にさせて悪かった。\n次からはもっと注意を払うよ。", "zh": "总之，让大家感到不安，真是对不起。\n下次我会更加注意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1031_p", "source_sha256": "ef36a2b7f7c9667f45f57a79d4747688a3b3c249a9f07baa7344dbcf31c1956e", "ja": "あ、電話……出版社からだ。\nすみません青羽さん、みんなの事、お願いします！", "zh": "啊，电话……是出版社打来的。\n抱歉，青羽小姐，大家就拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1032_102mis", "source_sha256": "3f3f2a97db294c531013c4a22f6b20a34404295c0ff263be380020c749d01d1d", "ja": "は～い！", "zh": "好的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1033_null", "source_sha256": "0c6947667069d1dd33c1aa62219913a56731eebbc4b20f0fbae5f7c2da6630c3", "ja": "ガチャ……バタン！", "zh": "咔哒……砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1034_011ami", "source_sha256": "33fa0a83c4b888f9ed03b3ddd3508e3e85f69096d8f261b95186fe1ecd795e4f", "ja": "兄ちゃんめ、うまく逃げたな……。\nまったく、逃げ足だけは速いんだから！", "zh": "臭老哥，跑得倒挺快嘛……。\n真是的，只有逃跑的时候特别快！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1035_102mis", "source_sha256": "3e631511c5fa912a4057a2593f1f34a659e26b5a4a2fc2aab73227bcc249825a", "ja": "{$P$}さんもお仕事だから、\n許してあげてね。けど……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生也是因为有工作嘛，\n你就原谅他吧。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1036_032emi", "source_sha256": "85f57f62bfc00cba98a294890804de679a7bbb937b88d66b5eb1614fb54f9f03", "ja": "？　美咲さん、何か気になることでも……？", "zh": "嗯？美咲小姐，您有什么在意的事吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1037_102mis", "source_sha256": "a8a028b4b8087953cc0c5c46de4079aeb31204d9b32d4a3bcd16c987ce5f5cb4", "ja": "あの{$P$}さんが逃げられないって、\nその京都のアイドルの人達、なんだかすごいかも……。", "zh": "连那个{$P$}先生都逃不掉，\n京都的那些偶像，总觉得可能相当厉害啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1038_011ami", "source_sha256": "39610e9f9e064415a35a75b13995dd72c13f3074aa8158ae9e7f1c3f51a82bef", "ja": "む！　それは……。", "zh": "唔！　那是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1039_033sih", "source_sha256": "7e8d80313b3bf3b49909054d1b3aa5c23dbba4c06f3cdf9cb2484b7c5a928717", "ja": "……そうですね。お客さんの反応といい、\n魅力的なアイドルだったのは、間違いないと思います。", "zh": "……确实呢。从观众的反应来看，\n她毫无疑问是一位极具魅力的偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1040_032emi", "source_sha256": "f1b4c9a41990294973715fcae40704225ac42a4e243b660cb297b32e5d39c2e8", "ja": "はい。場の空気を作る手練手管、実に見事でした。\n京都の大和撫子は、伊達ではないかと。", "zh": "是的。营造现场气氛的手段，实在高明。看来，京都大和抚子的名号，果然不是浪得虚名。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1041_047sub", "source_sha256": "3fb66e646464fc844466802ab0ea6d4c0ebc13dc44fba9c76c60ff99058b3aa6", "ja": "そりゃ、たしかにかわいかったけどさ……。", "zh": "那确实挺可爱的，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1042_047sub", "source_sha256": "eb1cc65650b074ce151f8dd5b9c99eee2d22846120da760d863fedaabf896f5d", "ja": "むう～……。", "zh": "唔～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1043_011ami", "source_sha256": "eb1cc65650b074ce151f8dd5b9c99eee2d22846120da760d863fedaabf896f5d", "ja": "むう～……。", "zh": "唔～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1044_null", "source_sha256": "7823f8c3b6be94411f17c1968ba69b64e83c516fdefe2ddece84d5a8321a6435", "ja": "その日の夜……", "zh": "当天晚上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1045_047sub", "source_sha256": "f1d47db202a09e7c00ff01ef9e702ad13b876eea11e09223982a30c69080ec17", "ja": "っつーわけで、京都のアイドルの作戦……かどうかは\nわからないけど、すっげーペース狂わされちゃってさ。", "zh": "所以说，京都的偶像使的策略……虽然不知道是不是吧，\n我的节奏被彻底打乱了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1046_souta", "source_sha256": "a517ce85c5a36861d4ca75211472b938c7c975db34995c7eb58d5f890a289245", "ja": "そっかー。たしかに、序盤でペース狂うと\n立て直すのムズいよな～。", "zh": "这样啊。确实，要是一开始就打乱了节奏，\n想重新调整过来可不容易啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1047_047sub", "source_sha256": "ca0a14d042514078a690d14a88daf143edcf564e8b0e9357742867ab96b860a9", "ja": "だろ！？\nさすが颯太兄ちゃん、わかってるな♪", "zh": "就是吧！？\n不愧是飒太哥哥，真懂我♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1048_subaani2", "source_sha256": "4f75a7fff01206dc9e2994ef70a744967d6b1646949857b42b70215addf00eb9", "ja": "いや、ピッチャーの立ち上がりとは違うだろ。\nアウェイなのは間違いないだろうけど。", "zh": "不，这和投手刚开始投球时的状态不一样吧。\n不过，确实是在客场没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1049_047sub", "source_sha256": "74e29442df4a69e9462a793551c20fd4670da13530a6560c69a0f1ae99beaf21", "ja": "もう、なんでそんな冷静なんだよ、\n大輝（たいき）兄ちゃんは！", "zh": "真是的，为什么大辉哥你能这么冷静啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1050_047sub", "source_sha256": "87010890a3920c09fc44858a695679c90f19a4e9d37828be1b923c8efaed6ffe", "ja": "せっかく初めてのお客さんもいたのに、\nオレたちのステージ、イマイチだったしさ……。", "zh": "难得还有第一次来看我们的客人，可我们的舞台表现也不怎么样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1051_047sub", "source_sha256": "9964c69270312aa8a7514a007d86854af3c45b4ea02ce57ab06467be8ba2b69e", "ja": "あーもー、ムカつくー！", "zh": "啊——真是的，好不爽啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1052_subaani3", "source_sha256": "0ccb2ea4c5f4aae2ab5b9479ceb69780aa332085edd1eb3b39bc43df4c62d122", "ja": "『D.O.S.S.』と……。へー、\n検索してみたけど、けっこうカワイイな。", "zh": "“D.O.S.S.”啊……嘿～\n我搜了一下，还挺可爱的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1053_047sub", "source_sha256": "958d6d28a7cceb661b708b4516f7c5ede60a12def2f829c055496f87cac760cb", "ja": "ええっ！？　祐翔（ひろと）兄ちゃんまで、\nなに言ってるんだよ！", "zh": "诶！？连祐翔哥哥都在说什么啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1054_047sub", "source_sha256": "8a839477f9e8ae76d2f92036bb01b3fface223c76e1fc01baa6ad5aa01df0fe9", "ja": "そんなアイドルなんかより、絶対絶対、\nぜ～～～ったい、オレたちのほうがカワイイから！", "zh": "比起那种偶像，我们绝对绝对，绝～～～对更可爱啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1055_subaanitachi", "source_sha256": "dbab4ce346e55370a22863f61bd2f4de05868866290cb8c1565b963cabeb1fbe", "ja": "ザワッ……", "zh": "骚动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1056_047sub", "source_sha256": "f7edf29810d30a1d3b9f283a6527a99eaf446efabbf6412daf05e2f7476c96ba", "ja": "え……な、なに？\nみんなして、こっち見て……。", "zh": "诶……怎、怎么了？\n大家都看着我这边……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1057_subaani1", "source_sha256": "77936e84278a33ef9e200efd9d0e03203ce3f920735ed759caabc6261c28e4d0", "ja": "いや……。昴の口からそんな言葉を\n聞くとは思わなかったから、驚いただけだ。", "zh": "没……只是没想到会从昴口中\n听到这种话，有点吃惊而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1058_047sub", "source_sha256": "89049534bcb0d4a424e3329ad70d1c662ccd2b036cad5220856e38af00c54f56", "ja": "えっ。そ、そんなコトないだろ、\n将人（まさと）兄ちゃん……。", "zh": "诶？没、没这回事吧，雅人哥……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1059_hiroto", "source_sha256": "854e2e53e85cc342dace3cf202d0939f2a695733e946d744e4cb5e20d5c1759a", "ja": "そんな事あるって！　昴が「オレたちのほうが\n絶対カワイイ」って言うなんて、大事件じゃん！", "zh": "这种事确实会发生啦！昴居然会说“我们才绝对更可爱”，这不是大事件吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1060_taiki", "source_sha256": "08224d57940536eab3fd01ff7e888b3dd90a764f86a0a0f6a8831658c60c0b3c", "ja": "俺達にカワイイって言われるだけで照れてた、\nあの昴が……お前、成長したんだな。（しみじみ）", "zh": "仅仅被我们夸可爱就会害羞的那个昴……你也成长了啊。（感慨万千）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1061_047sub", "source_sha256": "be0b2e6c9cf04221f9daf933179a2de665ee8db19ca92c3b0fc37d3848c5b24d", "ja": "そ、それは、オレがアイドルだからで……！\nていうか、今はそういう話じゃないだろ！", "zh": "那、那是因为我是偶像，所以才……！\n话说回来，现在不是说这个的时候吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1062_masato", "source_sha256": "851ff258eb2fea25aa8bbf866eaeaf1a52cefa57991052897a678be9ad644e50", "ja": "そうだな。それより昴、\n早く食べないと片付かないぞ。", "zh": "是啊。不过昴，\n不快点吃完的话就收拾不了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1063_047sub", "source_sha256": "92796ff8b28a0315d864032bdc317233a4eca3065f8fc513bf043d522ab974ff", "ja": "うう～……もういい！", "zh": "呜呜～……不管了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_02_1064_047sub", "source_sha256": "e18d524e6a5621bf026ddbfae840124aef11b8d583cfd89c705d76cd4ee1fcbb", "ja": "今日の洗い物は、祐翔兄ちゃんの当番だから！\nちゃんとやっとけよな！", "zh": "今天的碗是祐翔哥哥负责洗的！\n可要好好洗干净啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
